  "name": {
   "zh": "稠密 3D 跟踪点 · Track4World",
   "en": "Dense 3D Tracks · Track4World"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "Track4World 官方自述：以全局前馈的方式，从单目视频估计任意两帧之间每个像素的稠密三维场景流，在世界坐标系里稠密跟踪每一个像素。这张卡把点和摄影机一起写成 USD；顺带的点云是每帧一片，不是整段一套场景点云。",
   "en": "Track4World describes itself as estimating dense 3D scene flow for every pixel between any two frames of a monocular video in a global feed-forward way, densely tracking every pixel in world space. This card writes the points together with the camera to USD; the accompanying point cloud is one per frame, not one scene point cloud for the whole shot."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-13T12:00:00",
  "deliverable": "tracks3d",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
